## Flask-SocketIO Implementation

### Server Components
```python
# app_factory.py - Flask application factory
def create_app():
    app = Flask(__name__)
    app.config['SECRET_KEY'] = 'your-secret-key'

    # Initialize SocketIO
    socketio.init_app(app, cors_allowed_origins="*")

    return app

# socketio_events.py - Real-time communication
@socketio.on('connect')
def handle_connect():
    # Client connection handling

@socketio.on('drone_command')
def handle_drone_command(data):
    # Flight command processing

@socketio.on('request_telemetry')
def handle_telemetry_request():
    # Telemetry streaming setup
```

